<p>Offices that want a small celebration can host it at lunch and leave the actual tilak to the evening at home. Announcing a “Bhai Dooj hour” at 4:00 PM in a pan-India Slack channel will collide with someone’s puja window. Offer the leave. Do not schedule the rite.</p>
