<p>India’s kickoff habit is to convert everything into IST and argue. Do that conversion once, from an official London hour, after it exists, and pin the result. Until then, pin the date. Monday 26 October 2026, London, GMT in force, nominees not yet confirmed. That sentence is the whole story you need for a forward. Anything longer, this month, is decoration.</p>
