<p>Trains from Mumbai, Delhi and Jaipur into Sabarmati or Ahmedabad on Saturday 21 November will tighten after the onsale. Book the train when you book the ticket, not the other way around. If you are coming from a city that also has people travelling for other November events — Guwahati and Bengaluru have a rock tour the week before — you are not sharing their crowd, but you are sharing a month in which leave is already thin after Diwali. Ask for the Saturday now, as a maybe, and confirm when the seat exists. A maybe that you cancel is cheaper than a Saturday you discover is a shutdown at work.</p>
