<p>The announcement’s origin is part of the fact. He said the date from Wembley on 12 September 2026, after a show Live Nation promoted, and the reports agree he framed Ahmedabad as the next India step of the AURA tour. They do not agree on a support act, a ticket price, or a start time, because those were not announced. When the tour posts an onsale, the price on that system is the first real price. A number quoted before that post is a wish. Share the date and the stadium. Wait to share a link until the link is the official one.</p>
